      interactions: ["Wait at least 14 days after an MAOI before fluoxetine and at least 5 weeks after fluoxetine before an MAOI.", "Strong CYP2D6 inhibition can raise TCAs, several antipsychotics and class IC antiarrhythmics and can reduce tamoxifen activation.", "Other serotonergic drugs, NSAIDs/anticoagulants, diuretics and QT-risk drugs add serotonin syndrome, bleeding, hyponatremia or dysrhythmia risk."],
